    {
      "id": "u_0e83e5f47785db0c2110b607_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In Trilium, tabs allow easy switching between notes.",
      "sourceHash": "0e83e5f47785db0c2110b607db13cfca2fe60c3126ca16ca7d97a2d3f71c9bed",
      "context": "Tabs",
      "contextHash": "8e5ea509893e6dfd39126d7fb98c5237b273db19f11df5be8bca227fc11fe08a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1be850235fa38260299278b7_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Layout__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "1be850235fa38260299278b76672d24596fd6be877e00555a4070dbe3314f423",
      "context": "Tabs > Layout",
      "contextHash": "71471c51cc874919c3eec960b7a8c39467ae3fa2e5dbff09b9bf364e3cc15452",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_38f6f0b41ec4dfde7a1b8bbe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Depending on the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Vertical and horizontal layout__TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "38f6f0b41ec4dfde7a1b8bbea925011dd67f78501e002b7c418aaf44ecb1ac04",
      "context": "Tabs > Layout",
      "contextHash": "71471c51cc874919c3eec960b7a8c39467ae3fa2e5dbff09b9bf364e3cc15452",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a848074880531ed731dbd552_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For the vertical layout, the tabs will be placed at the top but to the right of the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "a848074880531ed731dbd552e0886f95ace4bbabb6e95130399354e358de2af6",
      "context": "Tabs > Layout",
      "contextHash": "71471c51cc874919c3eec960b7a8c39467ae3fa2e5dbff09b9bf364e3cc15452",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fa54c78b2adb2ad88600ce2f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For the horizontal layout, the tabs will be placed at the top in full-width, above the __TRILIUM_PH_0__note tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, allowing for more tabs to be comfortably displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "fa54c78b2adb2ad88600ce2f98454478714d6f5c08be8df18a901e854c609ef8",
      "context": "Tabs > Layout",
      "contextHash": "71471c51cc874919c3eec960b7a8c39467ae3fa2e5dbff09b9bf364e3cc15452",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_27591f4e86746d469eb2d832_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "27591f4e86746d469eb2d8323f6dda382149928ec0550ca8a5a6fdfc24cab9a6",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_55f119ee169764cf5e46f3e2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a new tab, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button that is to the right of the last tab.",
      "sourceHash": "55f119ee169764cf5e46f3e2291692812a7616923cc30e6888e3ca2ec6c20110",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f051067e17f8107cd5e0166a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right-clicking or pressing and holding the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button shows a menu with:",
      "sourceHash": "f051067e17f8107cd5e0166ad3ebed4dd4ea99ff6711a899471c6c847bdbee76",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c11f44f568376874771c7d22_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__New tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "c11f44f568376874771c7d229fb74b9c425c9bb9d5a4e5fd1b67978e70addb78",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a0f5bda164f84638ad639b22_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If there are any __TRILIUM_PH_0__Workspaces__TRILIUM_PH_1__, one entry per workspace, which opens the workspace in a new tab, hoisted into it.",
      "sourceHash": "a0f5bda164f84638ad639b22467362600e63da49895803666495dc803c89400a",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a87782f85ef474844f6584d3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Recently changed notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__: up to 15 notes, the most recently changed first, with the path of each note on the right. Notes that are already open in a tab are not listed, and in a __TRILIUM_PH_2__hoisted note__TRILIUM_PH_3__ only its descendants are. Selecting a note opens it in a new tab.",
      "sourceHash": "a87782f85ef474844f6584d30dbe167d52e73e6ea0b83e3ab8c058f2b443a208",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_97ada9770205f6cb297e7709_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__All recent changes__TRILIUM_PH_1__, which opens the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Recent Changes__TRILIUM_PH_3__ dialog.",
      "sourceHash": "97ada9770205f6cb297e7709d9fe15903e55c66a33fcdc487b8956bdd81f3589",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_779b46c59e57c12365e4f23e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To close a tab, press the corresponding __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button.",
      "sourceHash": "779b46c59e57c12365e4f23e28d066ecf23597ee3c69f6fa76107d07720e7422",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d227a224099693dd7cd6da83_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For multitasking, tabs can be used alongside __TRILIUM_PH_0__Split View__TRILIUM_PH_1__. Each tab can have one or more notes, displayed horizontally.",
      "sourceHash": "d227a224099693dd7cd6da830cd1777f2f101bff8a94fceefef46184ea3f89a4",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7644e259eb52a3ede240c178_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Tabs can be reordered by drag-and-dropping it into a new position.",
      "sourceHash": "7644e259eb52a3ede240c178d0e5e5a0b55120b7e28ece32d916d70855c78513",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2158560000babfb822c9d8bc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "An existing tab can be displayed in a new window by dragging the tab upwards or downwards. It is not possible to combine tabs back into another window.",
      "sourceHash": "2158560000babfb822c9d8bc46635b42d1cc955cdb41b9f916eb3967ae795727",
      "context": "Tabs > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "d7c574d2284c3d9785abe9764ad3783de8566a839be4b0e631ffe151c477204e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ba83851073d5d7241c55dc1b_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Keyboard interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "ba83851073d5d7241c55dc1b6f3c3ac0607891544c653ae071cfb7c1cd325edf",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_54f5914c313485cfc9e33824_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since tabs are a commonly used feature, there are multiple keyboard shortcuts that can be used:",
      "sourceHash": "54f5914c313485cfc9e3382417343df8c0c0ba4663713d5283f5d990a4829a7e",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0f826728073a27a1c2bf8178_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__T__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to open a new tab.",
      "sourceHash": "0f826728073a27a1c2bf817849bdb028a2f0f6ccab4542fdb3548321c5342ce7",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b6fa1035d58bace7d8a943c1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__W__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to close the current tab.",
      "sourceHash": "b6fa1035d58bace7d8a943c1c756cc5ef7067ebc86456e725e75899d3717591b",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_359ce1dceba4aa184cb4c093_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__T__TRILIUM_PH_5__ to reopen the last closed tab.",
      "sourceHash": "359ce1dceba4aa184cb4c0935e481aa8e08be03d972781ee8fd2dce72692fcb9",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_49231236e865808710ca4461_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and __TRILIUM_PH_4__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_5__+__TRILIUM_PH_6__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_7__+__TRILIUM_PH_8__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_9__ to go to the next or previous tab.",
      "sourceHash": "49231236e865808710ca44613fd30a2f3342918206871b830709170d9a53450a",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_764f2c83288cdc8aaf717bd1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__1__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_5__+__TRILIUM_PH_6__2__TRILIUM_PH_7__, up to __TRILIUM_PH_8__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_9__+__TRILIUM_PH_10__9__TRILIUM_PH_11__ to activate the first, second and up to ninth tab.",
      "sourceHash": "764f2c83288cdc8aaf717bd12cf4c34fb86b7828caf23f8f2bbfda3ea7fd00d7",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6e3461a58d0d1ab2cc0eff37_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "There is also a shortcut to go to the last tab, but it is not assigned a key by default.",
      "sourceHash": "6e3461a58d0d1ab2cc0eff37042e1e971117596da7113a9ef773332fe22f32f6",
      "context": "Tabs > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "2d87846edb836e90b7850956f78b3f3c2e7847bb23869f3fe337229b79c05b4c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_02653bedab9eb9f1960c6239_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Full screen__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "02653bedab9eb9f1960c6239561e94fc096941c85491c6319c0de5bcb97e2ab1",
      "context": "Tabs > Full screen",
      "contextHash": "df96d74499f352d4fe8280fbd78ed646beab35eb53a0df9cf56f397bce5dd2b3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_776b256e06c8dbc6c5e049f2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To show Trilium in full screen, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__F11__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Fullscreen__TRILIUM_PH_4__ button in the __TRILIUM_PH_5__Global menu__TRILIUM_PH_6__. While in full screen, the tab bar shows a __TRILIUM_PH_7__ __TRILIUM_PH_8__Leave full screen__TRILIUM_PH_9__ button before the __TRILIUM_PH_10__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_11__ toggle; press it to return to the normal window.",
      "sourceHash": "776b256e06c8dbc6c5e049f235893f3b20897b4d9b640df8fb13cd89b385e62c",
      "context": "Tabs > Full screen",
      "contextHash": "df96d74499f352d4fe8280fbd78ed646beab35eb53a0df9cf56f397bce5dd2b3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_329f848b15617fa119a7401e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Background tabs__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "329f848b15617fa119a7401e7e7896abb89ea632355466c853842003eb215b79",
      "context": "Tabs > Background tabs",
      "contextHash": "1921c709162a8267fd0128f1a34c5d6e611c37da842cfcf6f983e7d9daf388ee",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_60ef44de9c5bff6e9d241b70_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When Trilium starts, it reopens the tabs from the previous session. Only the active tab loads its note right away; every other tab loads its note the first time you switch to it. This keeps startup fast when many tabs are open, especially tabs that show collections.",
      "sourceHash": "60ef44de9c5bff6e9d241b708ea94dbd18056616d75fe9ce412bfb9566309860",
      "context": "Tabs > Background tabs",
      "contextHash": "1921c709162a8267fd0128f1a34c5d6e611c37da842cfcf6f983e7d9daf388ee",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f822f16f9f593a7362598ecd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The same applies to a tab opened in the background, for example with a middle click or __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+click on a link.",
      "sourceHash": "f822f16f9f593a7362598ecd07a86db14ce78a497be96ca6247ef8ba14b85af9",
      "context": "Tabs > Background tabs",
      "contextHash": "1921c709162a8267fd0128f1a34c5d6e611c37da842cfcf6f983e7d9daf388ee",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_155cfb2d8cfd2b36b9358101_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Mobile__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "155cfb2d8cfd2b36b9358101cae0289da8ea2554478710a3c0ec365d0d548d3b",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_899d4e4c15ef72d22f14be5b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Tabs are also supported on the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Mobile Frontend__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "899d4e4c15ef72d22f14be5b6173d6e36749305cfc466898d1deec6df87431ae",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ed75171e570e6b9611d1d8d9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since v0.102.0, the tabs are displayed by pressing the dedicated tab switcher button in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Launch Bar__TRILIUM_PH_1__. In this view the tabs are laid out on a grid with a preview of the note content. On a phone, a tab left on the note tree shows the folder it was on instead, with the tab's note highlighted. Swiping left or right on the launch bar goes to the next or previous tab directly, as long as all of its buttons fit on the screen, with the page following the finger until it lets go.",
      "sourceHash": "ed75171e570e6b9611d1d8d98196966fce0620c8dd5c233718138fe82576671d",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a62e30864fe2729032a17d03_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The context menu button at the top-right of the popup allows creating a new tab, reopening the last closed tab and closing all the tabs.",
      "sourceHash": "a62e30864fe2729032a17d03d0e7dae7215fd57e0f1c28c18adbe654846105b2",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9dc22d0d5285671eb510cebe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Split View__TRILIUM_PH_1__s are also indicated in the tab switcher, with two titles displayed in a tab.",
      "sourceHash": "9dc22d0d5285671eb510cebe391d42aecb0e071e2f462f630c565d3f22343834",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b8d08f67c7a95031fa95e20d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Versions prior to v0.102.0 also supported tabs, but they were displayed directly above the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Launch Bar__TRILIUM_PH_1__. The decision to use a more mobile-like tab switcher was taken because the original tab bar could not support many tabs at once and the new design better aligns with how mobile applications handle tabs.",
      "sourceHash": "b8d08f67c7a95031fa95e20d06ec3da76d5f27b5b015fd833de25705f16f9f17",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b190d47815633246b0ab18a6_0",
      "kind": "image-alt",
      "source": "記事画像",
      "sourceHash": "b190d47815633246b0ab18a61d9b8e8ea36504fe3f8bc230a7753096915c9ff2",
      "context": "Tabs > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "910858984af017f0b3756c31162e56dfd96f30e2bf76c9df3294dcded5a85db8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
